                    <chunk name="param_input" index="9">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Optional roughness length z0 (m) PER WIND DIRECTION, aligned with Wind Directions. The terrain the wind crosses differs by sector — sea to the west, city to the east — and one z0 for all of them puts the wrong profile on most inlets. A single value applies to every direction; a shorter list repeats its last value. Leave empty to use Roughness Length / Terrain Type for all directions. Each direction case writes its own z0 into 0/ABLConditions (inlet profile AND ground wall function).</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">2e1e6f70-7c57-4457-ac5c-a7b7a5d08a58</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">z0 per Direction</item>
